SUMMARY:Holywell Choose Your Distance
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Boris Kachscovsky\n\nChoose your distance!\n\nWe'll do 
 laps around Holywell with potentially some small trail run detours. Each la
 p is 3.6km and we'll loop back to the start so drop off whenever you've had
  enough. Great for those of you who might want to try for a longer distance
 .\n\n3.6k / 7.2k /10.8k / 14.4k / etc.\n\nHolywell is lovely with a bit of 
 a slope and some nice gas lamps\, but no sidewalks so bring as many lights 
 / hi-viz things you can muster!\n\nWe'll meet at the north entrance to Holy
 well. If driving park on Wells Road\, or along Holywell and meet at the int
 ersection of holywell and wells road.\n\n6-7min/km - though potentially slo
 wer if you make me run round a hundred times\, nobody left behind\n\nView o
 n Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3553763337243100
 638\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Sat\, 7 Nov @ 1:24 AM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Boris KachscovskyChoose your distance!
