  a slope and some nice gas lamps\, but no sidewalks so bring as many lights
  / hi-viz things you can muster!We'll meet at the north entrance to Holywel
 l. If driving park on Wells Road\, or along Holywell and meet at the inters
 ection of holywell and wells road.6-7min/km - though potentially slower if 
 you make me run round a hundred times\, nobody left behindView on Strava: h
 ttps://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3553763337243100638Synced f
 rom Strava Club 208705 on: Sat\, 7 Nov @ 1:24 AM
