SUMMARY:Ashleworth Adventure
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sarah Fowkes\n\nWe shall meet at 8am outside Ashleworth
  Hub.\nThe run is about 16.5 of trail with a small amount run on lanes. The
 re are some muddy parts\, through woods and fields. A little elevation here
  and there and lots of gates and stiles.\nThis will be a social run\, but y
 ou should be able comfortable covering this distance. \nWe should take abou
 t 3 hours and finish back at the Hub.\nI have asked if they would be able t
 o do bacon sandwiches for us ( I will book in advance)\nIf you click in I�
 �ll create a WhatsApp to finalise any dietary requirements etc.\nAny questi
 ons Sarah [Phone Number Redacted] (run leader)\n\n\n\nView on Strava: https
